 series:"第三部 · 玻璃島",title:"The Forest Path",zh:"森林小徑",scene:"night",blurb:"一條小徑通往島的另一面，那裡還有沒被記錄的生命。",
 words:"jungle bamboo bush nest flock feather creature squirrel mosquito colorful wrist",pages:[
 ["A local guide led Noah through a narrow path in the jungle. Bamboo rose above the wet ground, and a bush blocked part of the trail. High in a tree, a flock of birds circled a nest. One bright feather floated down beside Noah's shoe.","在地嚮導帶 Noah 穿過叢林中的小徑。竹子高高長在濕地上，一叢灌木擋住部分路面。樹頂一群鳥圍著鳥巢盤旋，一根鮮亮羽毛飄落在 Noah 鞋旁。"],
 ["A squirrel ran over a root. Noah wanted to follow it, but the guide warned him that some colorful creatures were poisonous. A mosquito landed on his wrist; he brushed it away and kept walking. The forest was alive in ways the map did not show.","一隻松鼠跑過樹根。Noah 想跟上去，但嚮導提醒，有些色彩鮮豔的生物帶毒。一隻蚊子停在他手腕上，他揮開後繼續走。這座森林的生命遠超過地圖能呈現的範圍。"],
 ["At the end of the trail, they found fresh tire marks near an empty clearing. The guide frowned. 'No vehicle is allowed here,' she said. Nora photographed the marks, but nobody guessed who had made them. They needed more than an impression.","小徑盡頭的空地旁有新鮮輪胎痕。嚮導皺眉說：「這裡禁止車輛進入。」Nora 拍下痕跡，但沒有人憑印象猜測是誰留下；他們需要更多證據。"]],
 quiz:[["Why did the guide stop Noah from following the squirrel?","Some creatures could be poisonous","The trail ended at a mall","He had lost his ticket","Birds were sleeping","嚮導提醒他某些生物帶毒。"],["What did they find near the clearing?","Fresh tire marks","A new train","A missing suitcase","A large hotel","空地旁有新鮮輪胎痕。"],["Why did Nora take photographs?","To record evidence","To make an advertisement","To sell the forest","To count birds only","拍照是為了留下可檢查的證據。"]]
