 words:"edit column quote trend ongoing weekly",pages:[
 ["A journalist asked Noah to edit his notes into a short column. The newspaper agreed to publish the water results, the map comparison, and direct quotations from the people involved. Noah checked every quote against his recorder before submitting the article.","一名記者請 Noah 把筆記編輯成短篇專欄。報社同意刊出水質結果、新舊地圖比較，以及當事人的直接引言。Noah 投稿前，把每段引述都和錄音逐一核對。"],
 ["The article appeared in a weekly paper. Within days, tourism businesses began asking how the ongoing investigation would affect visitors. A hotel manager showed Noah a chart: bookings had fallen, but the longer-term trend was still uncertain.","文章登在週刊上。幾天內，觀光業者開始詢問持續中的調查會如何影響遊客。飯店經理給 Noah 看圖表：訂房量下降了，但長期趨勢仍不確定。"],
 ["The next morning, a second letter arrived. It thanked the group for speaking openly but challenged a single date in the report. Nora checked her notes. If the date was wrong, the whole sequence of events might change.","隔天早上，第二封信寄來了。寫信人感謝團隊公開說明，卻質疑報告中的一個日期。Nora 翻看筆記；如果日期錯了，整個事件順序都可能改變。"]],
