 words:"stable protection decrease unity meaningful permit",pages:[
 ["Nora found the missing date in an old permit. The border had been drawn before the latest water test, not after it. The change was still worrying, but the team could not claim it had been made to hide the new result. They corrected the report in public.","Nora 在舊許可證上找到了缺漏的日期。界線其實在最新水質檢驗前就畫好了，不是之後。改動依然令人擔憂，但團隊不能宣稱那是為了隱瞞新結果；於是公開更正報告。"],
 ["Over the following months, the community created a steady schedule for testing water. Visitor numbers began to become stable, and the council funded protection for the bay. The ongoing work would not make pollution decrease overnight, but it gave people a way to measure change.","接下來幾個月，社區建立穩定的水質檢驗時程。遊客數逐漸穩定，議會也出資保護海灣。持續的工作不會讓汙染一夜減少，卻讓人有辦法測量變化。"],
 ["Noah returned home with a more meaningful understanding of his ambition. He had wanted to draw beautiful maps. Now he hoped to draw maps that people could trust. Nora wrote to him: 'Unity does not mean agreeing on everything. It means sharing the work of finding out what is true.'", "Noah 回家時，對自己的抱負有了更有意義的理解。他原本想畫漂亮的地圖，如今希望畫出值得信任的地圖。Nora 寫信給他：「團結不是每件事都同意，而是一起承擔查明真相的工作。」"]],
