 series:"第五部 · 消失的食譜",title:"The Recipe on the Back",zh:"背面的食譜",scene:"paper",blurb:"夜市老攤的招牌料理，突然有了不一樣的味道。",
 words:"apron chop onion sauce stir stove cooker raw flame",pages:[
 ["Tessa put on an apron before opening her family's night-market stall. Her father was the chef, but a pain in his hand meant she had to cook tonight. He told her to chop the onion, add pepper, and stir the sauce over a low flame on the stove.","Tessa 穿上圍裙，準備開張家裡的夜市攤位。父親原本是主廚，但手疼得無法掌廚，今晚得換她做菜。他要她切洋蔥、加胡椒，並用爐火的小火攪拌醬汁。"],
 ["The old cooker made a strange sound. Tessa switched it off before touching the pan. She tasted a tiny bit of sauce with a clean spoon; it was much sweeter than usual. On the back of the recipe, someone had written: 'Never serve the raw mixture.'", "舊炊具發出怪聲，Tessa 先關火才碰鍋。她用乾淨湯匙嘗了一小口醬汁，發現比平常甜很多。食譜背面有人寫著：「生的混合物絕對不能直接供應。」"],
 ["Her father studied the handwriting. 'That is not mine,' he said. A corner of the page had been torn away, exactly where the final ingredient should have been. Tessa decided not to sell the dish until they understood the missing instruction.","父親看著筆跡說：「那不是我寫的。」紙張一角被撕掉，正好是最後一項材料的位置。Tessa 決定弄清缺少的指示前，不賣這道菜。"]],
