 series:"第五部 · 消失的食譜",title:"The Grocery Receipt",zh:"雜貨店的收據",scene:"paper",blurb:"找到材料很容易，難的是找出哪一份清單才是真的。",
 words:"grocery flour wheat powder peel pineapple coconut peanut melon",pages:[
 ["The grocery owner remembered selling Tessa's father a bag of flour made from wheat, a jar of peanut powder, and several pieces of fruit. The receipt also listed a pineapple, a coconut, and a melon. Tessa wondered why a noodle dish needed so much fruit.","雜貨店老闆記得賣給 Tessa 父親一包小麥麵粉、一罐花生粉，還有幾樣水果。收據上也列著鳳梨、椰子和甜瓜。Tessa 不懂一份麵食為何需要那麼多水果。"],
 ["The owner showed her a second receipt. It came from a bakery next door, where workers peel fruit for desserts. Someone had mixed two orders into one list. Tessa compared the dates and recognized her father's handwriting on only the first page.","老闆拿出另一張收據，是隔壁烘焙坊的；那裡的員工會削水果做甜點。有人把兩筆訂單混成一張清單。Tessa 比對日期，發現只有第一頁是父親的筆跡。"],
 ["'That explains the extra ingredients,' she said. But the torn corner still bothered her. A clean list could stop the wrong dish from being served, yet it would not tell her who had changed the recipe—or whether it had been an accident.","「多出來的材料有解釋了，」她說。但那個撕掉的角落仍讓她介意。一份乾淨清單能防止端錯料理，卻無法告訴她是誰改了食譜，或者這是不是意外。"]],
 quiz:[["Why were so many fruits on the list?","Two orders had been mixed","The dish required every fruit","The shop gave them away","The fruit was for a school","兩份訂單混在一起。"],["Which page had her father's handwriting?","Only the first page","Both pages","Neither page","The outside of a jar","只有第一頁有父親筆跡。"],["What was still unexplained?","Who changed the recipe","Why wheat has flour","Where the grocery was","How to peel fruit","更改食譜的人仍未知。"]]
